      "value": "Materials related to Jacob Lawrence's Recent Works on Paper exhibition at Brockman Gallery in 1981, including:\n\nlamss0002-box06folder11_0002: a postcard with a reproduction of Lawrence's \"\"Confrontation of the Bridge\"\" on recto, and information about Lawrence's simultaneous shows at both Brockman Gallery and New Visions Gallery in San Diego.\nlamss0002-box06folder11_0014: a letter of invitation from Alonzo Davis to Jacob Lawrence to attend the opening of Lawrence's exhibition\nlamss0002-box06folder11_0068: an itinerary of Lawrence's schedule typed on Brockman Gallery letterhead\nlamss0002-box06folder11_0072: a press release announcing an exhibition of Lawrence's \"\"Builders\"\" serigraph series"
